window.EN={"1":"Having overcome countless hardships, Roy and the others at last advance their troops into Bern's homeland.","2":"There, they set their course for the \"Shrine of Seals\" that Guinevere had told them of, but","3":"there, Bern's main army, centered on the Bern Wyvern Knight order, which both friend and foe alike acknowledged as \"the continent's strongest,\"","4":"along with General Murdock, foremost of Bern's Three Dragon Generals, the strongest commander in the kingdom of Bern, lie waiting for Roy and the others.","5":"The kingdom of Etruria and the kingdom of Bern—a head-on decisive battle between the two nations that divide the continent.","6":"The \"longest day\" of this great war was now, at last, about to begin...","7":"The army's deployment—all of it is complete!","8":"Good. Well done.","9":"It's finally here, isn't it, Gail.","10":"Yes. Our preparations here are finished as well.","11":"In this operation, your unit will be the key. Understood?","12":"Leave it to me. I will surely live up to your expectations.","13":"Good. Let us make them learn the full dread of Bern's main army.","14":"But to think they've come this far at last... that general of the Lycian Alliance.","15":"You mean Lord Roy.","16":"I wonder what manner of fighting he does... I look forward to crossing swords with him.","17":"Oh, Lord Roy! I've finally managed to meet you.","18":"Why, it's none other than Priest Yodel!","19":"Whatever brings you here? All the way from Etruria, to a battlefield such as this...","20":"Based on the letter I received from you, Lord Roy, I looked into various things, and","21":"it seems something quite serious is happening, it would appear!","22":"As I thought, it's highly likely that Bern has indeed revived the \"Dragon-Devil\"!","23":"Really?!","24":"...But the \"Dragon-Devil\" should have been slain, long ago, by the hero Hartmut.","25":"Just how in the world did Bern...","26":"It seems that Hartmut","27":"did not deal the \"Dragon-Devil\" its final blow, after all.","28":"What did you say?!","29":"Rather than defeating the \"Dragon-Devil,\" he is said to have sealed it away in Bern's hinterlands instead.","30":"And at that time, the sword that sealed the \"Dragon-Devil\" was, it's said, that very legendary...","31":"The \"Sword of Seals,\" you mean?","32":"Oh my, so you already knew of it?","33":"Yes, I've heard a little about that matter...","34":"Even if the \"Dragon-Devil\" really has been revived, if only we can get our hands on the \"Sword of Seals,\"","35":"wouldn't it be possible, once again, to either defeat it or seal it away?","36":"That is the judgment the Church of Elimine has reached.","37":"And so, I was sent here in order to make that request of you, Lord Roy.","38":"Do we have no way of knowing where the \"Dragon-Devil\" is?","39":"As for that—just as that fire-breathing \"dragon\" does,","40":"if the \"Dragon-Devil\" too normally takes a human form, then...","41":"a woman who serves close by Bern's king, called the \"Priestess of Darkness,\" seems rather suspicious to me.","42":"The \"Priestess of Darkness\"...","43":"I have no firm proof, but...","44":"the time she appeared at the Bern king's side and the time the \"dragons\" began reviving are nearly the same.","45":".........","46":"They say the \"dragons,\" in order to adapt to this world that had become difficult for them to live in,","47":"sealed their power as dragons into stones called \"Dragonstones,\" and took on human form, or something like that...","48":"If that's so, then even if the \"Dragon-Devil\" has taken the form of a human woman,","49":"there would be nothing strange about it at all.","50":"In any case,","51":"it seems we won't be able to confirm the truth without meeting that woman ourselves.","52":"Yes. I will help with that as well.","53":"Priest Yodel, you will? That's a great help.","54":"And please, accept this too—a \"Divine Weapon\" that we managed to obtain.","55":"The Church of Elimine asked that it be delivered to you, Lord Roy.","56":"Even a \"Divine Weapon,\" no less!","57":"Lord Roy, if the \"Dragon-Devil\" truly","58":"has been revived, this is a crisis for all humankind, the likes of which hasn't been seen since the \"Scouring\"!","59":"Yes. Let us face it together, with everything we have!!","60":"Right, let's move out.","61":"Crush the enemy, every last one of them, without exception!","62":"Let them now learn well the dread of us Bern wyvern knights!!","63":"Why, Priest Yodel.","64":"Saul. You've worked hard.","65":"Thanks in part to you all supporting and fighting for Lord Roy,","66":"our Church of Elimine too has been saved.","67":"...If someone like me has been of even the smallest help,","68":"there's no greater joy than that.","69":"My, my, how unusually earnest you sound.","70":"Lady Yodel, appearances aside, I too am at least something of a priest, you know.","71":"When it comes to caring for others, I won't lose to anyone.","72":"That's true, forgive me.","73":"Well then, shall we go on together?","74":"Dorothy. Have you been well?","75":"Yes, it's been a while, Priest Yodel.","76":"You're always so cheerful, aren't you.","77":"God surely loves your heart dearly too.","78":"I wonder if that's so...","79":"Everyone who's touched by the purity of your heart has their own heart laid bare.","80":"Saul must have been the same, and I myself as well.","81":"Treasure that purity of heart.","82":"Yes, Father.","83":"Gail...","84":"Melady, is it.","85":"Gail, I...","86":"Say nothing.","87":"Both you and I are Bern's knights. We fight for the lord to whom we've sworn our loyalty.","88":"That's all there is to it.","89":".........","90":"Since this will likely be the last time, let me say just this much.","91":"Melady, I'm glad I got to know you.","92":"As wyvern knights polishing our skills together, fighting side by side on the battlefield,","93":"the days I spent with you were the happiest days of my life.","94":"I... I too...","95":"Farewell, Melady.","96":"If I could have, I would have wished to have met you in a more peaceful age.","97":"Gail...","98":"Wait, Gail, don't go!","99":"Gaaaaail!!","100":"Lord Gail...","101":"Zeiss, is it. You look well.","102":"Lord Gail, must we really fight, you and I?","103":"Yes.","104":"I... I don't want to fight you. You, of all people!","105":"Don't be so spoiled, Zeiss!","106":"Eh...","107":"Was that the extent of your resolve, when you left Bern?","108":"Was that the extent of your resolve, when you decided to fight against Bern?!","109":"That's not it!","110":"My resolve... is firm.","111":"Turning my spear against my homeland of Bern is still hard for me, even now...","112":"But it's precisely because I believed the path I chose wasn't wrong...!","113":"Then cast aside your doubts.","114":"And think only of crushing whoever stands in the way of the path you believe in.","115":"Even if that person should be anyone at all.","116":"Lord Gail...","117":"Zeiss, you're a full-fledged Bern wyvern knight too, aren't you!","118":"...Yes!","119":"The next time we meet, there'll be no more words exchanged between us. Understood, Zeiss!","120":"I have no regrets...","121":"Zeiss... I entrust Melady to you...","122":"※If fought with Roy: So you're General Roy, are you.","123":"Hee hee hee... I've been looking forward to crossing blades with you!","124":"※If fought with Melady: Melady, is it...","125":"It's not what I wish for, but since matters have come to this,","126":"fighting is unavoidable. Come then, come at me!","127":"※If fought with Zeiss: You, I recall, are one of Narcian's men...","128":"I've heard the story from Gail.","129":"I do pity you, but an enemy is an enemy. I'll show no mercy.","130":"Come then, come at me!","131":"※If fought with any other unit: Hmph... to think you'd come this far.","132":"Impressive. But can you really defeat me, I wonder?","133":"Guh... strong... indeed...","134":"Zephiel... my lord... it seems","135":"I can no longer... protect you...","136":"You lot, you're the Etrurian army, aren't you?","137":"There's not a single soldier here.","138":"I'll give you this village's treasure, so please, leave without doing anything!","139":"※If Melady and Zeiss both survive, and the castle was taken within 30 turns","140":"Lord Roy... this shrine seems to have an entrance leading underground.","141":"An entrance leading underground... I wonder if the \"Sword of Seals\" is there.","142":"I don't know... but,","143":"I was told something that caught my attention, by a Bern soldier we took prisoner.","144":"They said two sacred things are enshrined within the \"Shrine of Seals\"...","145":"! That means...","146":"Could it be that there's one more \"Divine Weapon\"?","147":"...I wonder.","148":"It might be worth asking someone of Bern origin within this army.","149":"Understood. Let's look into it right away.","150":"※If either Melady or Zeiss has died, or the castle was taken on turn 31 or later","151":"Lord Roy, what's embedded in this pedestal is...","152":"So this is the \"Sword of Seals.\"","153":"Let's see, let's see... hm? It... it won't come out...","154":"That's because it's sealed. You have to use the \"Fire Emblem.\"","155":"How does one use it, I wonder?","156":"From what Princess Guinevere said, you embed it in the sword's hilt...","157":"Whoa, what's this?","158":"The sword has started to glow.","159":"I think this will let it come free. Let me try.","160":".........!...","161":"...This is...","162":"...Just what...?","163":"The \"Sword of Seals\"...","164":"Hartmut's... memory...?","165":"!","166":"That person... who...?","167":"I wonder... somehow, it feels very...","168":"Lord Roy? Wh-what's the matter?","169":"No... I'm fine. It's nothing.","170":"So this is... the \"Sword of Seals\" the hero Hartmut once used...","171":"Am I... really allowed to use it?","172":"They say that, since ancient times, a fine sword chooses its own master.","173":"That sword is now in your hand, Lord Roy... which means, surely, that's simply how it is.","174":"But it's only by chance that this sword is in my hand.","175":"What we think of as chance...","176":"even that may well be just one part of the wheel of fate.","177":".........","178":"In any case! Now that we've obtained the \"Sword of Seals,\" all that's left is to head for Bern's royal palace.","179":"This is no time to be faint of heart, Lord Roy!","180":"You're right. The confrontation with King Zephiel awaits!!"};
